Subject: [PATCH 35/40] tracker 0.8.0: console over Bluetooth for 3 minutes
 after a boot (blecon; GATT service with sealed frames keyed with usb_key,
 private address, deny list, window rules, blepair exclusion, ESP32 sleep
 lock; CONFIG_BT_PRIVACY, no DIS)

---
 zephcore/boards/common/tracker.conf |  13 +-
 zephcore/src/lt_version.h           |   2 +-
 zephcore/src/main_tracker.cpp       | 711 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 717 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/zephcore/boards/common/tracker.conf b/zephcore/boards/common/tracker.conf
